{"seq":1,"slug":"false-positive-appeal","title":"误判申诉与白名单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/price-patrol-governance/false-positive-appeal","wordCount":3485,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"误判申诉与白名单\">误判申诉与白名单</h1><p>一个卖家做的是收藏品生意，店里一件 1990 年代的限量模型标价 ¥28,000。巡检的品类离群判据把它判成了 <code>high</code>——同品类（按标题匹配到的&quot;模型玩具&quot;）的中位数是 ¥300，它高了近百倍。卖家申诉，附上了拍卖成交记录与品相照片。这个案例暴露的正是价格巡检最本质的困难：<strong>统计上离群不等于事实上错误</strong>，而把每一个这类案例都做成一次人工申诉，成本会随商品规模线性增长。因此误判处理必须同时具备两条腿——<strong>单条申诉的纠正通道</strong>，以及<strong>让同类误判不再产生的类目级白名单</strong>。缺前者，被误判者无路可走；缺后者，申诉队列会无限增长。</p>\n<p>本文处理误判的识别、纠正与回流。处置动作本身见 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/price-freeze-delist-action\">价格冻结/下架处置</a>，整改闭环见 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/merchant-rectify-notify\">商家整改通知与复核</a>，而规则版本的取舍与判定重放见 <a href=\"price-rule-version-audit\">巡检规则版本与审计</a>。本文的边界是<strong>从「判定被主张有误」到「判定被纠正且同类误判被抑制」的整条路径</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>申诉系统最容易做错的地方是把它当成一个客服工单系统。工单系统的优化目标是「尽快关闭」，而申诉系统的优化目标是<strong>把判定错误率降下来</strong>。这两个目标在短期是对立的：快速关闭工单的最省事做法是驳回，而降错误率要求认真区分「商家在狡辩」与「系统真的错了」。</p>\n<p>区分这两者的关键是把申诉拆成<strong>两个可独立判定的问题</strong>：事实层（这条报价在该规则下的判定是否正确）与政策层（即使判定正确，该情形是否应当被豁免）。事实层是客观的，可以用规则重放给出确定答案；政策层是主观的，需要人来定，但它一旦被定下来，就应当被固化为白名单规则，从而不再需要逐条判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>申诉主张</th>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>判定方式</th>\n<th>处理产物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据不是这个值</td>\n<td>事实</td>\n<td>重放判定 + 证据快照</td>\n<td>纠正或驳回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则不适用于此品类</td>\n<td>政策</td>\n<td>人工/专岗判断</td>\n<td>类目级白名单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>该商品具有特殊属性</td>\n<td>政策</td>\n<td>人工判断 + 属性核验</td>\n<td>属性级例外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则阈值太紧</td>\n<td>政策</td>\n<td>误报率统计分析</td>\n<td>规则阈值调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处置过重</td>\n<td>政策</td>\n<td>处置策略评估</td>\n<td>处置策略调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行与第四行的产物不是「给这个商家开个口子」，而是<strong>修改系统参数</strong>。这是申诉系统最有价值的部分：它是误报信号的采集器，输出喂给规则与策略的调参流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"白名单是风险接受-不是豁免特权\">白名单是风险接受，不是豁免特权</h3><p>白名单必须被正确定义为一个<strong>治理决定</strong>：平台明知某个品类或某个模式会持续产生告警，决定不再对其告警，并接受由此带来的漏检风险。这个定义带来两条纪律。第一，白名单必须<strong>有理由、有期限、有责任人</strong>——「永久白名单」在监管问询时是无法解释的，因为监管会问「你们知道这个品类有价格风险，为什么完全不巡检」。第二，白名单必须是<strong>窄的</strong>：白名单一个品类会同时放过该品类下真正的违规，因此优先顺序永远是属性级例外 &gt; 子类目级白名单 &gt; 品类级白名单。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[商家提交申诉] --&gt; B[冻结证据快照&lt;br/&gt;原判定的输入]&#10;  B --&gt; C[规则重放: 事实层]&#10;  C --&gt; D{事实层判定正确?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[纠正: 撤销处置 + 撤销违规记录]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[政策层评估]&#10;  F --&gt; G{同类误报可归因于?}&#10;  G --&gt;|品类特性| H[类目级白名单候选]&#10;  G --&gt;|商品属性| I[属性级例外]&#10;  G --&gt;|阈值过紧| J[规则阈值调整候选]&#10;  G --&gt;|无需豁免| K[驳回并附依据]&#10;  H --&gt; L[误报率验证&lt;br/&gt;回放历史判定]&#10;  I --&gt; L&#10;  J --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; M{验证通过?}&#10;  M --&gt;|否| K&#10;  M --&gt;|是| N[发布新规则版本&lt;br/&gt;见 4/2]&#10;  E --&gt; O[回流: 记录误判样本]&#10;  K --&gt; O&#10;  N --&gt; O&#10;  O --&gt; P[误判率度量&lt;br/&gt;见 4/3]\">flowchart TD\n  A[商家提交申诉] --&gt; B[冻结证据快照&lt;br/&gt;原判定的输入]\n  B --&gt; C[规则重放: 事实层]\n  C --&gt; D{事实层判定正确?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[纠正: 撤销处置 + 撤销违规记录]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[政策层评估]\n  F --&gt; G{同类误报可归因于?}\n  G --&gt;|品类特性| H[类目级白名单候选]\n  G --&gt;|商品属性| I[属性级例外]\n  G --&gt;|阈值过紧| J[规则阈值调整候选]\n  G --&gt;|无需豁免| K[驳回并附依据]\n  H --&gt; L[误报率验证&lt;br/&gt;回放历史判定]\n  I --&gt; L\n  J --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; M{验证通过?}\n  M --&gt;|否| K\n  M --&gt;|是| N[发布新规则版本&lt;br/&gt;见 4/2]\n  E --&gt; O[回流: 记录误判样本]\n  K --&gt; O\n  N --&gt; O\n  O --&gt; P[误判率度量&lt;br/&gt;见 4/3]</pre><h3 id=\"申诉受理不该要求先整改\">申诉受理不该要求先整改</h3><p>一个常见的流程设计是「先整改，再申诉」。它的动机是防止商家用申诉拖延处置，但后果是把程序责任转移给了被处置方：如果判定本身是错的，要求商家先按错误结论修改数据，等于强迫他执行一个错误的指令。正确做法是<strong>两条通道并行</strong>：整改通道与申诉通道互为前提，且<strong>申诉一旦开启即暂停整改期限计时</strong>，理由与时限语义见 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/merchant-rectify-notify\">商家整改通知与复核</a>。平台对限制措施的告知与救济义务在欧盟《数字服务法》中有明确要求——对用户采取限制措施必须给出清晰具体的理由说明并保障救济途径（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32022R2065\">Regulation (EU) 2022/2065</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事实层-用重放而不是用回忆\">事实层：用重放而不是用回忆</h2><h3 id=\"判定必须可重放\">判定必须可重放</h3><p>事实层的判定不需要人，它需要的是<strong>判定重放能力</strong>：用原判定时的输入快照、原规则版本、原基线版本，重跑一遍判定器，看结论是否一致。这个能力的前提是判定记录保存了输入快照而不是引用，相关设计见 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/price-patrol-batch-job\">批量价格巡检任务</a> 与 <a href=\"price-rule-version-audit\">巡检规则版本与审计</a>。</p>\n<p>重放会得到三种结果。<strong>一致且正确</strong>：判定无技术错误，进入政策层。<strong>一致但依据已失效</strong>：判定在当时正确，但基线或汇率数据后来被证明有问题（例如用了错误的汇率口径），这类需要连同数据源一起修。<strong>不一致</strong>：说明判定器或数据管道存在缺陷，这是最高优先级的问题——它意味着该规则的全部判定都不可信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 事实层重放：用原快照与原规则版本重跑判定&#10;WITH snap AS (&#10;  SELECT v.verdict_id, v.offer_id, v.market, v.rule_rev, v.baseline_rev,&#10;         v.hit_rules, v.evidence&#10;  FROM patrol_verdict v&#10;  WHERE v.verdict_id = $1&#10;)&#10;SELECT s.verdict_id,&#10;       s.hit_rules                                  AS original_hits,&#10;       replay_verdict(s.rule_rev, s.baseline_rev, s.evidence) AS replayed,&#10;       s.evidence -&gt; &#39;price&#39;     AS price_at_decision,&#10;       s.evidence -&gt; &#39;cost&#39;      AS cost_at_decision,&#10;       s.evidence -&gt; &#39;baseline&#39;  AS baseline_at_decision&#10;FROM snap s;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事实层重放：用原快照与原规则版本重跑判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verdict_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">offer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_rev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">baseline_rev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hit_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> patrol_verdict v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verdict_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verdict_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hit_rules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                  AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> original_hits,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       replay_verdict(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_rev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">baseline_rev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replayed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'price'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_at_decision,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cost'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_at_decision,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'baseline'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_at_decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snap s;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据源的错误要单独处理\">数据源的错误要单独处理</h3><p>有一类申诉的主张是「你们用的数据是错的」，典型情形包括：用了错误的汇率口径（相关口径的区分见 <a href=\"../abnormal-price-detect/currency-conversion-anomaly\">多币种换算与汇率异常</a>）、成本锚过期、品类画像被标题错误匹配。这类申诉成立时不应只撤销本条处置，而要<strong>追溯影响面</strong>：用同一数据源、同一时间窗重算，找出所有受影响的判定。这就是「一致但依据已失效」必须与「不一致」分开的原因——它的修法不是改判定器，而是修数据源并做范围化的纠正。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主张</th>\n<th>影响面识别方式</th>\n<th>纠正范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>汇率口径用错</td>\n<td>同口径 + 同日期窗</td>\n<td>该汇率日期窗内的全部折算判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本锚过期</td>\n<td>同 cost 快照版本</td>\n<td>使用该快照的全部判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类匹配错误</td>\n<td>同映射版本</td>\n<td>该映射版本下的全部判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基线被促销污染</td>\n<td>同基线版本 + 同分组</td>\n<td>该基线下该分组的全部判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的最后一行是价格巡检特有的：品类基线在计算时若未剔除促销价，会把整个品类的中位数压低，从而把正常商品判为高价离群。这类错误的识别与基线构造纪律见 <a href=\"../abnormal-price-detect/price-distribution-outlier\">基于分布的离群价巡检</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"白名单与例外的建模\">白名单与例外的建模</h2><h3 id=\"三种粒度的例外\">三种粒度的例外</h3><p>例外必须按粒度建模，粒度决定了漏检风险的大小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>表达</th>\n<th>漏检风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品级</td>\n<td><code>offer_id</code></td>\n<td>极低（单条）</td>\n<td>极特殊的孤品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性级</td>\n<td>品类 + 属性断言</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>收藏品、限量品、样品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子类目级</td>\n<td>子类目 ID + 规则 ID</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>单位价格不适用的小类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类级</td>\n<td>品类 ID + 规则 ID</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>几乎不用；需治理批准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>商品级例外是危险的</strong>，与直觉相反。它的风险不在于漏检量大，而在于它不可维护：一个头部商家可能有一百万个 offer，逐个开例外会形成一张无法审计的巨表，且商家可以借由持续新增商品绕过规则。因此商品级例外必须设置数量上限与到期时间，并要求商家提交可核验的理由。</p>\n<p>属性级例外是效果最好的一档，因为它把「为什么可以例外」写成了一个可核验的事实断言。收藏品的例外不是「这个商品比较贵」，而是「该商品具备 <code>collectible=true</code> 且 <code>authenticated_by</code> 非空」。断言可核验，就可在规则求值时作为条件求值，也可以在事后核查真伪。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;whitelist_rule_id&quot;: &quot;WL-2026-0417&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rule_ref&quot;: [&quot;PS-011&quot;, &quot;PP-M1&quot;],&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;attribute&quot;,&#10;    &quot;category_id&quot;: 4412,&#10;    &quot;assertion&quot;: &quot;collectible = true AND authenticated_by IS NOT NULL&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: [&quot;US&quot;, &quot;DE&quot;],&#10;  &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;收藏品与限量品的价格分布与普通品类不可比，横截面判据持续误报&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evidence&quot;: { &quot;appeals_30d&quot;: 63, &quot;appeal_granted_ratio&quot;: 0.91, &quot;historical_fp_estimate&quot;: 0.88 },&#10;  &quot;risk_accepted&quot;: &quot;该类目下真实的高价离群将不再被发现，替代措施：仅保留时序跳变判据&quot;,&#10;  &quot;approved_by&quot;: &quot;pricing-governance&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effective_to&quot;: &quot;2027-09-28T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;review_at&quot;: &quot;2027-03-28T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"whitelist_rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WL-2026-0417\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PS-011\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PP-M1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"category_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4412</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"assertion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"collectible = true AND authenticated_by IS NOT NULL\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"收藏品与限量品的价格分布与普通品类不可比，横截面判据持续误报\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"appeals_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">63</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"appeal_granted_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.91</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"historical_fp_estimate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"risk_accepted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"该类目下真实的高价离群将不再被发现，替代措施：仅保留时序跳变判据\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"approved_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pricing-governance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-09-28T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"review_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-03-28T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四个字段是这份记录的核心。<code>risk_accepted</code> 把接受的漏检风险写清楚，并指定替代措施——白名单往往不应完全关闭该主体的全部判据，而是只关掉误报最严重的那一两条。<code>evidence</code> 让白名单的批准有数据依据，而不是某个人的判断。<code>effective_to</code> 与 <code>review_at</code> 保证例外会被重审，避免变成永久豁免。<code>approved_by</code> 让责任可追溯。</p>\n<h3 id=\"白名单求值必须在判定器内部\">白名单求值必须在判定器内部</h3><p>一个实现细节决定了白名单是「有效」还是「危险」：白名单必须在<strong>判定器内部</strong>作为条件参与求值，而不能做成判定之后的过滤器。原因在于豁免往往需要影响判据本身的计算——例如收藏品豁免应当让该商品不进入品类基线的样本集，否则它会拉高品类中位数并影响其他商品的判定。做成后置过滤器就不能做这件事。相关纪律在 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/price-patrol-batch-job\">批量价格巡检任务</a> 的判定缓存设计中还有一层影响：白名单规则版本必须进入缓存键，否则白名单生效后旧结论仍被复用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 判定器内部的豁免求值：豁免同时影响入样与判据&#10;WITH scoped AS (&#10;  SELECT o.offer_id, o.category_id, o.price, o.currency,&#10;         w.whitelist_rule_id,&#10;         (w.whitelist_rule_id IS NOT NULL) AS exempt_from_cross_section,&#10;         w.scope -&gt; &#39;assertion&#39; AS exemption_assertion&#10;  FROM offer_current o&#10;  LEFT JOIN active_whitelist w&#10;    ON w.rule_ref @&gt; ARRAY[&#39;PS-011&#39;]&#10;   AND w.market @&gt; ARRAY[o.market]&#10;   AND w.scope -&gt;&gt; &#39;category_id&#39; = o.category_id::text&#10;   AND (w.scope -&gt;&gt; &#39;assertion&#39; IS NULL OR evaluate_assertion(o, w.scope -&gt;&gt; &#39;assertion&#39;))&#10;  WHERE o.sellable_state = &#39;active&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT offer_id, price,&#10;       CASE WHEN exempt_from_cross_section THEN &#39;exempt&#39; ELSE &#39;in_scope&#39; END AS scope_state,&#10;       -- 基线样本必须排除被豁免的商品，否则豁免会污染其他商品的判定&#10;       (SELECT percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY price)&#10;        FROM scoped s2 WHERE NOT s2.exempt_from_cross_section&#10;          AND s2.category_id = s.category_id) AS baseline_median&#10;FROM scoped s;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判定器内部的豁免求值：豁免同时影响入样与判据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> scoped</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">offer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">whitelist_rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">whitelist_rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exempt_from_cross_section,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assertion'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exemption_assertion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_current o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_whitelist w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">['PS-011']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[o.market]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'category_id'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assertion'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evaluate_assertion(o, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assertion'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sellable_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_id, price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exempt_from_cross_section </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'exempt'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_scope'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scope_state,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 基线样本必须排除被豁免的商品，否则豁免会污染其他商品的判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> scoped</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exempt_from_cross_section</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_median</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> scoped</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"白名单的反作弊约束\">白名单的反作弊约束</h3><p>白名单一旦可申请，就会成为规避规则的通道。三条约束能显著提高滥用成本：<strong>属性断言必须可由平台侧独立核验</strong>（不依赖商家自报）、<strong>同类例外对该商家设有频率上限</strong>、以及<strong>白名单生效后仍保留一条低严重度观测规则</strong>（例如收藏品豁免横截面判据后，仍保留时序跳变判据）。最后一条的价值在于白名单期间仍然产生数据，使得重审时有依据，而不是在重审时才发现「这两年完全没有观测」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误判回流与度量\">误判回流与度量</h2><h3 id=\"误判样本是调参的第一手材料\">误判样本是调参的第一手材料</h3><p>每一条被判定为「事实层判定错误」的申诉都是一个<strong>带标签的误报样本</strong>。这些样本的用途不是个案补救，而是三条回流路径：</p>\n<p><strong>路径一，规则阈值调整</strong>：某条规则的误报在特定分组（品类、价格档位、市场）集中出现，则调整该分组的阈值或分组方式。<strong>路径二，白名单生成</strong>：误报集中在某个可核验的属性上，生成属性级例外。<strong>路径三，判据下线</strong>：某条规则的误报率长期高于阈值且无法通过前两条收敛，则应评估下线该规则，相关流程见 <a href=\"price-rule-version-audit\">巡检规则版本与审计</a>。</p>\n<p>回流的度量口径与 <a href=\"price-violation-trend\">价格违规趋势看板</a> 共用：核心两个量是<strong>申诉率</strong>（申诉数 / 处置数）与<strong>申诉通过率</strong>（通过数 / 申诉数）。它们的组合读法很重要——申诉率低而通过率高，说明规则判得准但可解释性差（商家不知道怎么申辩）；申诉率高而通过率低，说明商家在试探；两者都高，说明规则有系统性缺陷，必须走白名单或阈值调整。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>appeal</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>grant</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>disposition</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>detect</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{fp}} \\approx \\frac{N_{\\text{appeal}} \\cdot r_{\\text{grant}}}{N_{\\text{disposition}} \\cdot c_{\\text{detect}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposition</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">detect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">appeal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">grant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>grant</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{grant}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">grant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是申诉通过率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>detect</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{detect}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">detect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「被误判的商家中有多大比例会申诉」——这个量无法直接观测，因此上式给出的是误报率的一个<strong>下界估计</strong>。在进行误报率比较时（例如判断白名单是否应该扩展），必须使用同一个下界口径，否则不同时间的数字不可比。</p>\n<h3 id=\"申诉处理时延与-沉默成本\">申诉处理时延与「沉默成本」</h3><p>申诉系统有一个容易被忽略的成本项：<strong>处理时延本身</strong>。一条被误判且处置仍在生效的申诉，每延迟一小时的代价是商家的真实收入损失。因此申诉通道需要一个明确的服务目标（例如 24 小时内首次响应、72 小时内结论），并且这个目标要作为可观测指标出现在治理看板上。相关目标设定与告警方式可以参考站点可靠性工程中对服务目标与错误预算的处理方式（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/service-level-objectives/\">Google SRE Book, Service Level Objectives</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>申诉系统不是工单系统：工单优化「尽快关闭」，申诉必须优化「降低判定错误率」。</li>\n<li>申诉要拆成事实层（可用判定重放给出确定答案）与政策层（需要人判断，且判断结果应固化为白名单或参数）。</li>\n<li>申诉受理不以先整改为前提，且申诉开启必须暂停整改期限计时。</li>\n<li>事实层靠<strong>判定重放</strong>：用原输入快照、原规则版本、原基线版本重跑判定器；重放结果分一致且正确、依据已失效、不一致三类，第三类是最高优先级缺陷。</li>\n<li>「数据源错误」类申诉要识别影响面并做范围化纠正，而不是只撤销本条处置。</li>\n<li>白名单是<strong>风险接受</strong>而非豁免特权：必须有理由、有期限、有责任人，优先属性级而非品类级；商品级例外最危险，必须限额与到期。</li>\n<li>白名单求值必须在判定器内部（豁免需要影响基线入样），且其版本必须进入判定缓存键。</li>\n<li>白名单需要反作弊约束：属性断言可独立核验、同类例外限额、豁免期间保留低严重度观测。</li>\n<li>误判回流有三条路径：阈值调整、白名单生成、判据下线；申诉率与申诉通过率必须组合解读。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>被纠正的判定与生效的白名单如何进入规则版本体系、如何保证历史判定可追溯，见 <a href=\"price-rule-version-audit\">巡检规则版本与审计</a>；误判率、申诉率与覆盖率如何合成治理效果视图，见 <a href=\"price-violation-trend\">价格违规趋势看板</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"误判申诉与白名单","id":"误判申诉与白名单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"白名单是风险接受，不是豁免特权","id":"白名单是风险接受-不是豁免特权"},{"level":3,"text":"申诉受理不该要求先整改","id":"申诉受理不该要求先整改"},{"level":2,"text":"事实层：用重放而不是用回忆","id":"事实层-用重放而不是用回忆"},{"level":3,"text":"判定必须可重放","id":"判定必须可重放"},{"level":3,"text":"数据源的错误要单独处理","id":"数据源的错误要单独处理"},{"level":2,"text":"白名单与例外的建模","id":"白名单与例外的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"三种粒度的例外","id":"三种粒度的例外"},{"level":3,"text":"白名单求值必须在判定器内部","id":"白名单求值必须在判定器内部"},{"level":3,"text":"白名单的反作弊约束","id":"白名单的反作弊约束"},{"level":2,"text":"误判回流与度量","id":"误判回流与度量"},{"level":3,"text":"误判样本是调参的第一手材料","id":"误判样本是调参的第一手材料"},{"level":3,"text":"申诉处理时延与「沉默成本」","id":"申诉处理时延与-沉默成本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商家整改通知与复核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/patrol-task-enforce/merchant-rectify-notify"},"next":{"title":"巡检规则版本与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/price-patrol-governance/price-rule-version-audit"}}